    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, honesty is important, but they're going to be looking for any reason to squeeze our price down. I'm particularly worried about how we handle the patent. If they bring up the recent legal filing regarding the validity of our core data processing patent, what's our move? Do we tell them about the potential invalidation risk, or is there a better way to frame that?",
